 - **Project PHP extension profiles.** Set `[php] extensions` to the extensions available on your deployment target. Completion and built-in lookup keep project polyfills and exclude unavailable extension declarations after restarting the service. Contributed by PHP Workbench (local downstream patch).
 
 ### Fixed
+
+- **Route warnings refresh across open files.** Editing or discarding a route registration now refreshes affected open route declarations and callers without saving. Contributed by @thinkycz.
 
 - **Call hierarchy follows trait constructors.** Constructor calls point to the composed trait implementation, including inherited constructors and named aliases, and incoming calls retain those construction sites. Ambiguous trait aliases do not invent a target. Contributed by @thinkycz.
 
